@startuml
title 実装予定: 共通操作規則と phase 別開始前提で操作可否を分離する

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #555555
  FontColor #222222
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #eaf7ff
  BorderColor #2c7fb8
}

legend left
  |<#dff0d8> 追加予定 |
  |<#fcf8e3> 変更予定 |
  |<#eeeeee> 既存接続先 |
  |<#f2dede> 廃止対象 |
endlegend

package "既存入口\nBackend UseCase" as UseCasePackage #eeeeee {
  component "翻訳ジョブ管理 UseCase" as JobManagementUseCase #eeeeee
  component "各フェーズ UseCase\nterm / persona / body" as PhaseUseCase #eeeeee
  component "ジョブ作成 UseCase" as JobSetupUseCase #eeeeee
}

package "internal/usecase/translationjobpolicy\nUseCase 専用の操作可否ポリシー" as PolicyPackage #dff0d8 {
  component "Policy\nEvaluate(input)" as Policy #dff0d8
  component "OperationRuleCatalog\n共通操作規則" as OperationRuleCatalog #dff0d8
  component "PhasePrerequisiteCatalog\nstart 専用の phase 別開始前提" as PhasePrerequisiteCatalog #dff0d8
  component "ServiceCommandMap\nphase type から service method を選ぶ" as ServiceCommandMap #dff0d8
  component "GuardFacts\n判定済み事実" as GuardFacts #dff0d8
  component "PolicyInput\nstate / event / guard / target phase" as PolicyInput #dff0d8
  component "PolicyResult\nallowed / rejected / command / state effect" as PolicyResult #dff0d8
  component "Event 定数\nstart / pause / resume / retry / cancel" as EventConst #dff0d8
  component "State 定数\njob / phase_run" as StateConst #dff0d8
}

package "internal/jobio\n状態 snapshot と保存" as JobIOPackage #fcf8e3 {
  component "JobIOService" as JobIO #fcf8e3
  component "TransitionSnapshotBuilder\nPolicyInput の材料を作る" as SnapshotBuilder #fcf8e3
  component "StateChangeApplier\n確定済み状態事実だけ保存" as StateChangeApplier #fcf8e3
}

package "既存 Service\n実処理だけを担当" as ServicePackage #eeeeee {
  component "TermTranslationService" as TermService #eeeeee
  component "PersonaGenerationService" as PersonaService #eeeeee
  component "BodyTranslationService" as BodyService #eeeeee
  component "TranslationJobManagementService" as JobManagementService #eeeeee
}

package "既存永続化境界" as RepositoryPackage #eeeeee {
  interface "JobLifecycleRepositoryPort" as JobLifecycleRepositoryPort
  database "TRANSLATION_JOB\nJOB_PHASE_RUN" as JobTables #eeeeee
}

package "廃止対象" as RemovedPackage #f2dede {
  component "internal/statemachine" as OldStateMachine #f2dede
  component "StateMachineFacade" as OldFacade #f2dede
  component "JobState / PhaseRunState\n状態 class 群" as OldStatePattern #f2dede
  component "Ready 作成時の\npending phase run 事前作成" as PendingPlaceholder #f2dede
  component "operation summary\nDB 永続保存" as OperationSummaryDB #f2dede
  component "各 Service 内の\n状態遷移可否判断" as InlineBranching #f2dede
}

JobManagementUseCase --> JobIO : snapshot 取得
PhaseUseCase --> JobIO : snapshot 取得
JobSetupUseCase --> JobIO : ready job 保存

JobManagementUseCase --> Policy : job 操作を評価
PhaseUseCase --> Policy : phase_run 操作を評価
JobSetupUseCase --> Policy : 作成後表示を評価

JobIO --> SnapshotBuilder
JobIO --> StateChangeApplier
SnapshotBuilder --> JobLifecycleRepositoryPort : 読み出し
StateChangeApplier --> JobLifecycleRepositoryPort : 確定済み状態保存
JobLifecycleRepositoryPort --> JobTables

SnapshotBuilder --> PolicyInput : 材料を作る
PolicyInput --> Policy
Policy --> OperationRuleCatalog : 共通操作規則を評価
Policy --> PhasePrerequisiteCatalog : start の時だけ開始前提を評価
Policy --> ServiceCommandMap : 許可後の service method を選ぶ
Policy --> GuardFacts : guard 評価結果を読む
Policy --> PolicyResult
PolicyResult --> JobIO : 直接保存しない

PhaseUseCase --> TermService : ServiceCommand target=term
PhaseUseCase --> PersonaService : ServiceCommand target=persona
PhaseUseCase --> BodyService : ServiceCommand target=body
JobManagementUseCase --> JobManagementService : ServiceAction=delete / cancel_ready など

OperationRuleCatalog --> EventConst
OperationRuleCatalog --> StateConst
PhasePrerequisiteCatalog --> StateConst
ServiceCommandMap --> EventConst

OldStateMachine -[#red,dashed]-> PolicyPackage : 置き換え
OldFacade -[#red,dashed]-> Policy : 使わない
OldStatePattern -[#red,dashed]-> OperationRuleCatalog : 共通操作規則に集約
PendingPlaceholder -[#red,dashed]-> JobIO : 作らない
OperationSummaryDB -[#red,dashed]-> PolicyResult : 導出用 reason だけ返す
InlineBranching -[#red,dashed]-> Policy : 可否判断を移す

note bottom of PolicyPackage
  translationjobpolicy は UseCase 専用とする。
  Service、Repository、Controller からの import は禁止する。
  PolicyResult は UseCase 内の一時値とする。
  rule 名や判定履歴は DB に保存しない。
end note

note bottom of OperationRuleCatalog
  共通操作規則は phase type を主キーにしない。
  pause、resume、retry、cancel、terminal guard を扱う。
end note

note bottom of PhasePrerequisiteCatalog
  phase type は start の前提確認でだけ使う。
  term、persona、body の参照成立を判定材料にする。
end note

note bottom of ServiceCommandMap
  phase type は呼び出す service method の選択にも使う。
  この選択は操作可否判断ではない。
end note

note bottom of JobIOPackage
  JobIOService は取得と保存だけを扱う。
  遷移可否は判断しない。
  policy の判断結果は保存しない。
  確定済み状態事実だけを保存する。
end note

note bottom of ServicePackage
  Service は provider 実行、pause、retry などの実処理だけを扱う。
  状態遷移可否は判断しない。
end note

@enduml
